{"id":"30.5.9.2","doc":"T","title":"Supported CMD Values in Half-Duplex Communication","words":1172,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In half-duplex communication, the defined values of CMD determine the transfer types."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Unsupported CMD values are disregarded, meanwhile the related transfer is ignored and "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_SLV_CMD_ERR_INT_RAW"},{"t":"text","v":" is set."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The transfer format is CMD (8 bits) + ADDR (8 bits) + DUMMY (8 SPI_CLK cycles) + DATA (unit in bytes)."}]},{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The detailed description of CMD[3:0] is as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x1 (Wr_BUF): CPU-controlled write mode."}]},{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Master sends data and "},{"t":"block","v":"GP-SPI","id":"spi"},{"t":"text","v":" receives data."}]},{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The data is stored in the related address of "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_W0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_W15_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x2 (Rd_BUF): CPU-controlled read mode."}]},{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Master receives the data sent by GP-SPI."}]},{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The data comes from the related address of "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_W0_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" ~ "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_W15_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x3 (Wr_DMA): DMA-controlled write mode."}]},{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Master sends data and GP-SPI receives data."}]},{"n":13,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The data is stored in GP-SPI "},{"t":"block","v":"GDMA","id":"gdma"},{"t":"text","v":" RX buffer."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":14,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x4 (Rd_DMA): DMA-controlled read mode."}]},{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Master receives the data sent by GP-SPI."}]},{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The data comes from GP-SPI GDMA TX buffer."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x7 (CMD7): used to generate an SPI_SLV_CMD7_INT interrupt."}]},{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"It can also generate a GDMA_IN_SUC_EOF_CH"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":"_INT interrupt in a slave segmented transfer when GDMA RX link is used."}]},{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"But it will not end GP-SPI's slave segmented transfer."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x8 (CMD8): only used to generate an SPI_SLV_CMD8_INT interrupt, which will not end GP-SPI's slave segmented transfer."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":21,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x9 (CMD9): only used to generate an SPI_SLV_CMD9_INT interrupt, which will not end GP-SPI's slave segmented transfer."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":22,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0xA (CMDA): only used to generate an SPI_SLV_CMDA_INT interrupt, which will not end GP-SPI's slave segmented transfer."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":23,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The detailed function of CMD7, CMD8, CMD9, and CMDA commands is reserved for user definition."}]},{"n":24,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"These commands can be used as handshake signals, the passwords of some specific functions, the triggers of some user defined actions, and so on."}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":25,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"1/2/"},{"t":"num","v":"4-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" modes in states of CMD, ADDR, DATA are supported, which are determined by value of CMD[7:4]."}]},{"n":26,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The DUMMY state is always in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode and lasts for eight SPI_CLK cycles."}]},{"n":27,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The definition of CMD[7:4] is as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":28,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x0: CMD, ADDR, and DATA states all are in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":29,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x1: CMD and ADDR are in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]},{"n":30,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"DATA is in "},{"t":"num","v":"2-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":31,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x2: CMD and ADDR are in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]},{"n":32,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"DATA is in "},{"t":"num","v":"4-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":33,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x5: CMD is in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]},{"n":34,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ADDR and DATA are in "},{"t":"num","v":"2-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":35,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0xA: CMD is in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode, ADDR and DATA are in "},{"t":"num","v":"4-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode."}]},{"n":36,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Or in QPI mode."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":37,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"In addition, if the value of CMD[7:0] is 0x05, 0xA5, 0x06, or 0xDD, DUMMY and DATA states are skipped."}]},{"n":38,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The definition of CMD[7:0] is as follows:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":39,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x05 (End_SEG_TRANS): master sends 0x05 command to end slave segmented transfer in SPI mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":40,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0xA5 (End_SEG_TRANS): master sends 0xA5 command to end slave segmented transfer in QPI mode."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":41,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0x06 (En_QPI): GP-SPI enters QPI mode when receiving the 0x06 command and the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_QPI_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" in register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SPI_USER_REG"},{"t":"text","v":" is set."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":42,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"0xDD (Ex_QPI): GP-SPI exits QPI mode when receiving the 0xDD command and the bit "},{"t":"field","v":"SPI_QPI_MODE"},{"t":"text","v":" is cleared."}]}]}]]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":43,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"All the CMD values supported by GP-SPI are listed in Table 30.5-14 and Table 30.5-15."}]},{"n":44,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note that DUMMY state is always in "},{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode and lasts for eight SPI_CLK cycles."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 30.5-14. Supported CMD Values in SPI Mode","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Transfer Type"}],[{"t":"text","v":"CMD[7:0]"}],[{"t":"text","v":"CMD State"}],[{"t":"text","v":"ADDR State"}],[{"t":"text","v":"DATA State"}]],"rows":[{"n":45,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Wr_BUF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x01"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}]]},{"n":46,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Wr_BUF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x11"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"2-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}]]},{"n":47,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Wr_BUF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x21"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"4-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}]]},{"n":48,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Wr_BUF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x51"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"2-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"2-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}]]},{"n":49,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Wr_BUF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0xA1"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"4-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"4-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}]]},{"n":50,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"Rd_BUF"}],[{"t":"text","v":"0x02"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}],[{"t":"num","v":"1-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" mode"}]]},{"n":51,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"R